message: "If you use ĀML™ in research or technical work, please cite this project."
title: "ĀML — ĀRU Meaning Language"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Read"
    given-names: "Daniel Jacob"
    name-suffix: "IV"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6133-1872"
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
abstract: >-
  ĀML is a working research prototype for meaning-native, policy-aware,
  accountable AI interfaces. It provides semantic intent modeling,
  policy evaluation, execution receipts, conformance tooling, cross-system
  negotiation, bounded authority, provenance, and verifiable trust primitives
  while compiling to existing browser-compatible output.
repository-code: "https://github.com/aruintelligence/aml-core"
url: "https://aruintelligence.com/"
license: MIT
